<title>SWEDEN: Table of Swedish govt economic forecasts in budget.</title>
<headline>Table of Swedish govt economic forecasts in budget.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the key economic indicators as forecast and projected in the Swedish government's supplementary budget on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				 1997    1998    1999   2000</p>
<p> CPI (Dec-Dec)	     1.8     1.5     2.0    2.0</p>
<p> Unemployment		7.9     7.1     5.6    4.5</p>
<p> Household savings ratio 3.8     3.2     4.6    5.4</p>
<p> Private consumption     2.0     2.0     2.1    2.0</p>
<p>Assumptions:</p>
<p>  Swedish 5-yr rate	5.6     5.9     6.1    6.3</p>
<p>  TCW index		119.2   117.9   117.0  117.0</p>
<p>				  1996   1997     1998</p>
<p> GDP			    1.1     2.3	2.5</p>
<p> Exports			5.6     6.3	5.8</p>
<p> Imports			3.5     5.1	5.6</p>
<p> Trade balance (bln SKR) 120.0   135.9   152.9</p>
<p>Current account balance</p>
<p>    (Pct of GDP)	    2.5     3.5	4.2</p>
<p> Industrial production    2.1     4.8	4.3</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
